OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will start mainly
OL,6,Fdry, though rather cloudy. Skies will
OL,7,Fbrighten from the south during the
OL,8,Fmorning, with plenty of very warm
OL,9,Fsunshine developing. However, through
OL,10,Fthe afternoon a further increase in
OL,11,Fcloud could generate a few showers.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a rather cloudy
OL,14,Fevening and night with scattered
OL,15,Fshowers giving way to some heavier and
OL,16,Fmore persistent outbreaks of rain,
OL,17,Fespecially in the north and west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
